{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":21298,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":1969,"episodeCount":26,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kFFRiNaQJub24cgiNmDfLjZj9oT.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"594844","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Il racconto di Hyakkimaru, parte prima","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"戦国の地侍であった醍醐景光は自分の野望に対する生贄として生まれてくる自分の子どもの体を48体の魔神に捧げた。そのせいで身体のうち48箇所を奪われて生まれてきた赤ん坊は、あまりのおぞましさに川へと捨てられてしまう。しかし赤ん坊は生き延び、百鬼丸と名乗って成長した…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-04-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2dAqttYS6kBaf11Ac9qBu0NzsGP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2dAqttYS6kBaf11Ac9qBu0NzsGP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"594845","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Il racconto di Hyakkimaru, parte seconda","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"どろろに付きまとわれて困り果てた百鬼丸は、追い払うために自分の呪われた身の上を聞かせてやった。イモ虫のような姿で生まれてきたのだが寿光という名の医者が足りない部品を義手や義足や義眼で補ってくれて、ようやく生き延びることが出来たのだと…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-04-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2pUinO4tcL6YQlUSLmLfAAMwlKy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2pUinO4tcL6YQlUSLmLfAAMwlKy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"594846","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Il racconto di Bandai, parte prima","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"川原で野宿をする百鬼丸とどろろは、金小僧という妖怪と出会った。とくに悪さをするわけでもないその妖怪のことを翌日、村で話すと、そのせいで2人は村人に捕らえられ、村の女名主、万代の屋敷の敷地内にある小屋に閉じ込められてしまう。その夜、小屋の近くにある古井戸から、見るも醜怪な妖怪が現われた…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-04-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yTsX06lGVzzQNnrAAP1dKqv8JoZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yTsX06lGVzzQNnrAAP1dKqv8JoZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"594847","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Il racconto di Bandai, parte seconda","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"金小僧は埋められた金から生まれた精霊だった。金の埋まっている場所を金小僧は百鬼丸に教え、村人たちがそこを掘り返すと精霊の教えたとおりに金が出てくる。それはもともとは村人が例の醜怪な妖怪に奪われた金だった。女名主の万代はそんな村人を哀れんで金を恵んでやっていたのだという…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-04-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aFkDYUngEfUDrqw4cz9H0jZbJbK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aFkDYUngEfUDrqw4cz9H0jZbJbK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"594848","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Il racconto della miseria, parte prima","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"旅の途中、熱病にかかって倒れたどろろを看病していた百鬼丸は、その時はじめてどろろの悲しい過去を知った。どろろは貧しい夫婦の子として生まれた。生きるために夫婦は野盗となり、やがてどろろの父親、火袋は侍と金持ちだけを狙う盗賊団の首領となったのだった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-05-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/skJx8MdLLhPAS6tg4SWlBAsQC0L.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/skJx8MdLLhPAS6tg4SWlBAsQC0L.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"594849","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Il racconto della miseria, parte seconda","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"追っ手を指揮していたのは裏切った部下だった。その部下は恩があるからと火袋を殺さず、変わりに両足に矢を撃ちこんで彼から両足の自由を奪うのだった。歩けない火袋と乳飲み子を抱えた妻のお自夜は、ついに乞食も同然に落ちぶれてしまい、火袋はからかい半分の侍の手にかかって殺されてしまう…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-05-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f8jatL3tur7Rxj3NeMKmFL7GERt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f8jatL3tur7Rxj3NeMKmFL7GERt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"594850","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Il racconto della spada demoniaca Nihiru, parte prima","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"その刀は、持ち主の心を奪い、支配してしまう妖刀だった。その妖刀に取り憑かれた田之介という男は、いきなり百鬼丸に戦いを挑んでくる。刀が血を求めているのだ。刀泥棒のどろろは、そんな妖刀に魅せられ、とうとう田之介から刀を盗んでしまう。しかし同時にどろろは妖刀によって心を支配されてしまい…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-05-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ofpH9ulX7oGjW8KLg6JISO87LHc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ofpH9ulX7oGjW8KLg6JISO87LHc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"594851","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Il racconto della spada demoniaca Nihiru, parte seconda","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"どろろが立てこもった鍛冶屋の小屋に火を放った田之介は妖刀を取り戻すことに成功した。しかしその途端、田之介は村人を斬り捨て始める。刀はもっと多くの血を求めていた。どろろを助けた百鬼丸は、田之介と対峙し、妖刀と剣を交える…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-05-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/owIAK6UfqIPT8ECYcHb3mEDcvzZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/owIAK6UfqIPT8ECYcHb3mEDcvzZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"594852","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Il racconto del Banmon, parte prima","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"小高い丘に「ばんもん」と呼ばれる大きな板塀が立っていた。そこで一夜を過ごすことにしたどろろと百鬼丸に、九尾の妖狐が襲いかかる！ 夜明けと共に妖狐は消え去ったが、無許可で国境を越えようとした者たちの処刑が始まってしまう。その処刑を指揮しているのは百鬼丸の父、醍醐景光だった!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dLPe65euI5NgibKheWkCm4SHxlf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dLPe65euI5NgibKheWkCm4SHxlf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"594853","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Il racconto del Banmon, parte seconda","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"九尾の妖狐を退けた百鬼丸の腕を見込んで、景光は仕官を奨める。しかし百鬼丸は、いわれなきリンチの末に川へ投げ込まれたどろろを探しに出る。そこで彼は1人の女性と出会う。母であった。母の顔など知らない百鬼丸だったが、その女性の目の中に、確かな愛と悲しみが湛えられているのに気づく…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A25jtKShfl7J6ibqqQ1K5WBE25B.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A25jtKShfl7J6ibqqQ1K5WBE25B.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"594854","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Il racconto del Banmon, parte terza","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"多宝丸の指揮する軍の奇襲を受け、助六の両親は殺され、村は焼かれた。助六もどろろも仲間たちと共に連行され、ばんもんに磔にされてしまう。どろろは危ういところを百鬼丸に助けられた。多宝丸は敵方を救う百鬼丸を見て斬り捨てようとするが、逆に百鬼丸の剣によって斬り捨てられてしまう…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jWaufzZqYFVfYtjt4xMy2i1vakN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jWaufzZqYFVfYtjt4xMy2i1vakN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"594855","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Il racconto di Fudou dal volto bianco, parte prima","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"百鬼丸に去られ、またしても天涯孤独の身になってしまったとどろろ。そんなどろろの前に1人の女性が現れる。どろろの母にそっくりなその女性に優しく慰めれ、どろろは女性について行く。どろろは懐かしい母の面影を見て、女性になつき甘えるが、この女性、実は山中の滝に巣くう妖怪、白面不動の手下なのだった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u2CCBNe2kkgH6BnXvUHbkOhXJHN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u2CCBNe2kkgH6BnXvUHbkOhXJHN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"594856","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Il racconto di Fudou dal volto bianco, parte seconda","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"白面不動は手下の女性に、どろろの顔を要求した。どろろを滝壺に落とせ、と。だが自分を母のように慕っているどろろが可愛くなり、女性は不動の命令に従えない。どろろと白面不動から逃げる女性だが、不動に操られた山犬の群に襲われ、その牙により身体を切り裂かれてしまう。そして、どろろにも野犬の群が襲いかかる…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3h5ALDPKohlM6c9EhJ3MqO6Qkbk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3h5ALDPKohlM6c9EhJ3MqO6Qkbk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"594857","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Il mostro Kajirinkon","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"どろろは、山門の仁王像に踏みつけられて動きを封じられていた天の邪鬼を自由にしてしまう。天の邪鬼は大喜びで村へと飛び込んで行き、悪戯のしほうだいで村中を大騒ぎに巻き込んでしまう。止めようとしたどろろは逆に天の邪鬼の仲間だと思われ、村人に追われてしまうが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/raQ9KRo4iRBIkNoxc1XZHUnn4Sr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/raQ9KRo4iRBIkNoxc1XZHUnn4Sr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"594858","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Il villaggio vuoto","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"どろろと百鬼丸は暴れ牛を軽々と頭上に持ち上げて制止する怪力の侍、俵五呂兵衛と知り合い、3人で旅することになる。五呂兵衛は妖怪も死霊も信じないと豪語する男だったが、百鬼丸と共にいる限り、死霊が向こうからよってくることになり…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r79JCoUCJyXyggkDUF9W4JHpaN2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r79JCoUCJyXyggkDUF9W4JHpaN2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"594859","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Midoro, il cavallo spettrale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"愛馬みどろの優秀な働きで侍大将に手が届きそうな時野景行は、すべての武功が愛馬のおかげとは思わず、慢心していた。そしてみどろの動きが鈍いのは子馬が付いて回るせいだと言って、みどろから子馬を奪い、売り飛ばしてしまう。その子馬を買ったのがどろろと百鬼丸だった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xE1ZxEvc8dNj9bZz6ofo0S4x80X.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xE1ZxEvc8dNj9bZz6ofo0S4x80X.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"594860","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Il mostro Donburibara","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"食い意地の張った村長に妖怪どんぶりばらが取り憑いた。村長に腹が膨れて破裂するほど穀物を食べさせては、へそから体内に入って養分を吸い取ってしまう。それがどんぶりばらだった。だから食べても食べてもお腹がいっぱいにならない村長は、村中の穀物を平らげようとする。そんな村にどろろと百鬼丸が通りかかる…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dx1BHeoLYqPeqdfUUScXr6aI5ou.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dx1BHeoLYqPeqdfUUScXr6aI5ou.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"594861","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Il mostro marino fluttuante","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"漁村にさしかかったどろろと百鬼丸。どろろは岩に突き刺さった銛を面白半分に抜いてしまう。しかし、その銛はビラビラと呼ばれる白骨化したエイの妖怪を封じていたものだった！ 地中から海へと逃れたビラビラを追って、百鬼丸は海へと飛び込む。しかし格闘の末、百鬼丸の姿が消えてしまう…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AqIalMk65TllSKouLp2GbV7mrTK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AqIalMk65TllSKouLp2GbV7mrTK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"594862","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Raikaken","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"子犬を道連れにして峠へとさしかかったどろろと百鬼丸に突如、妖犬が襲いかかる。妖犬は雷を操り、落雷に吹っ飛ばされてどろろは失神、百鬼丸は谷底へ落ちてしまう。川下の村で救われた百鬼丸は、その村が闘犬の盛んな村だと知る。その残酷なまでの犬の調教を見て、百鬼丸は峠の妖犬の正体を見抜くのだった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tOKN65blQvKBiedk0huMeA29cCl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tOKN65blQvKBiedk0huMeA29cCl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"594863","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Il demone Onbura","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"その地蔵は子守を求めていた。自分のお守りをしてくれなければ村を荒らすと、村人たちを脅していた。しかも子守を差し向けると、その子守は食い殺されてしまう。村人は仕方なく何も知らない旅人を好条件で子守に雇っていた。そうとは知らないどろろは子守募集の立て札を見て、喜んで子守を買って出る…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/btNq9Nyv1F8HIE2f8aWEfpdWEwM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/btNq9Nyv1F8HIE2f8aWEfpdWEwM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"594864","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Onba la falena","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"道行きの途中、牛車とすれ違った百鬼丸はただならぬ妖気に気づいた。牛車を牽いていたのは鯖目という名の侍で、乗っていたのは妻のまいまいおんばだった。まいまいおんばも百鬼丸にただならぬ気配を感じ、鯖目に百鬼丸を斬ってくれと頼む。その攻撃をかわした百鬼丸はまいまいおんばの正体を暴こうと彼女の館に潜入する…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hpRTZRUvdCjd26bCcFj3UdzMMNh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hpRTZRUvdCjd26bCcFj3UdzMMNh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"594865","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Il lamento dello spirito","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"その村にはたった1人の女の子しか暮らしていなかった。訳を聞くと村の者たちは全員が金を探しに山へ入ったきりなのだと言う。金がゴロゴロしていると聞いたどろろは「おいらも！」と女の子に案内させて山へ入って行く。しかし村の人々が消えたのは最近のことではないと見て取り、山に妖怪の気配を感じた百鬼丸は…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4IjahblpNOxA7ACXjfJclyyhge4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4IjahblpNOxA7ACXjfJclyyhge4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"594866","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Il grande albero mangia-uomini","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"砦を作るのに邪魔だとされ、樹齢2000年を越える大木が切り倒されることになった。そこへ行き会わせた百鬼丸はその大木に強烈な妖気を感じる。老木には常になにがしかの精霊が宿るものだが、この大木から発せられるそれには、邪悪な気配が濃厚だった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-09-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wlixN0Wva4HYri4j1Qa3l0LX8g7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wlixN0Wva4HYri4j1Qa3l0LX8g7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"594867","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Il bonzo dalle quattro forme","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"川辺で水浴びをしていたどろろは、魚取りの仕掛けに腕をはさまれてしまう。助けを求めるどろろを見て、百鬼丸は仕掛けを外す道具を借りに近くの寺へと向かった。その寺の住職は快く道具を貸してくれたが、百鬼丸はこの住職から漂う妖気に気づいた。川に戻ってみるとどろろの姿がない…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-09-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/89z8X5bSXCS4RieW8qOynM2tgJA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/89z8X5bSXCS4RieW8qOynM2tgJA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"594868","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Il mostro sotterraneo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大変なまけ者なグウ太郎は、10年間も同じ場所に座ったまま動くことさえしないらしい。しかし彼は動くに動けないのだ。彼の尻には経文が書かれていて、その尻を地べたにくっつけていることで、地中に潜む妖怪を封じているのだ。可哀想に思ったどろろは体を洗ってやるのだが、経文まで洗い落としてしまい…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-09-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7gw35n0qHYyAIw37NvX1IO2bDLQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7gw35n0qHYyAIw37NvX1IO2bDLQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"594869","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"L'ultimo mostro","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"どろろは自分の両親と同じように貧しい農民たちが一揆を起こそうとしているのを知り、自分も仲間になると志願。百鬼丸に別れを告げた。百鬼丸は1人で旅を続けて妖怪を倒していく。そしてとうとう念願の48匹退治まであと1匹となった。そんな百鬼丸に怪しげな老婆が言った。「最後の魔物はお前の父、醍醐景光！」と…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-09-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":27,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ohU1DJUFRReDeHdv7wMr8dV9e7h.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ohU1DJUFRReDeHdv7wMr8dV9e7h.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1/episode/26"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/21298/season/1"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793430454534,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"13":{"checkedAt":1793430454